=== Training-curve shape ===
Per-epoch validation metrics are available from folder-10 step-2 training logs. Across encoders, the median seed's val_f1 peak occurs around epoch 5.0 (mean plateau width near peak val_f1 about 1.3 epochs). Val_f1-best epoch is not universally epoch 1; a later-epoch well-trained region exists for many runs.
  Loaded enriched pool cache (enriched_primary_pool.parquet)

=== Two-axis trajectory ===
Per-epoch benchmark F1 and KB trajectories are available for the three focus encoders. Compare whether benchmark and KB peak at different epochs within the same seed.

